    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/af7921c824080522454df1a4d9151db9.poster.avif?t=1714480448\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/af7921c824080522454df1a4d9151db9.webm?t=1714480448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/af7921c824080522454df1a4d9151db9.mp4?t=1714480448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;JIPOIZ&quot; is a battle action game where you choose four weapons you want<br><br>Depending on the weapon, there are differences in the amount of damage, the speed and number of attacks, and the mechanisms of replacement and special attacks<br><br>The goal is to win by reducing all of the opponent's physical strength while preserving one's own physical strength.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A variety of weapons that you can choose according to your taste </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/44687916383ba2bd57c51aa22bffc614.poster.avif?t=1714480448\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/44687916383ba2bd57c51aa22bffc614.webm?t=1714480448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/44687916383ba2bd57c51aa22bffc614.mp4?t=1714480448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Weapons are largely classified into three categories: (short-range, long-range, special) Combine weapons with clear pros and cons to your liking.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > My own attack combination </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/b4ee52ed8da46f31f4ece1484c11b98b.poster.avif?t=1714480448\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/b4ee52ed8da46f31f4ece1484c11b98b.webm?t=1714480448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/b4ee52ed8da46f31f4ece1484c11b98b.mp4?t=1714480448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Combine basic and special attacks properly, replace weapons, give them anomalies, and take control of the opponent's psychology to continue the flow of attacks<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > STEMINA </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/f9e2ddcb4c0d05d00d3ad8c73747a2e3.poster.avif?t=1714480448\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/f9e2ddcb4c0d05d00d3ad8c73747a2e3.webm?t=1714480448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/f9e2ddcb4c0d05d00d3ad8c73747a2e3.mp4?t=1714480448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Apart from physical strength, the character has a Stemina.<br><br>Stemina decreases under set conditions, such as being attacked or using a special attack, and the character faints as soon as it becomes zero.<br><br>When you pass out, the manipulation is limited and the damage you suffer increases. Take good care of your stamina and bring your victory.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/af7921c824080522454df1a4d9151db9.poster.avif?t=1714480448\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/af7921c824080522454df1a4d9151db9.webm?t=1714480448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/af7921c824080522454df1a4d9151db9.mp4?t=1714480448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;JIPOIZ&quot; is a battle action game where you choose four weapons you want<br><br>Depending on the weapon, there are differences in the amount of damage, the speed and number of attacks, and the mechanisms of replacement and special attacks<br><br>The goal is to win by reducing all of the opponent's physical strength while preserving one's own physical strength.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A variety of weapons that you can choose according to your taste </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/44687916383ba2bd57c51aa22bffc614.poster.avif?t=1714480448\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/44687916383ba2bd57c51aa22bffc614.webm?t=1714480448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632840/extras/44687916383ba2bd57c51aa22bffc614.mp4?t=1714480448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Weapons are largely classified into three categories: (short-range, long-range, special) Combine weapons with clear pros and cons to your liking.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > My own attack combination </h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" au